From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:42:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix: resolve SigmaDetection type incompatibility for
 condition property

- Modify SigmaDetection interface to accept condition as optional property
- Update index signature to allow string | string[] values
- This fixes TypeScript's strict index signature validation for the condition property
- Eliminates 12 cascading TS2322 errors in detection generators

Reduces TypeScript errors from 146 to 134.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PcqZQMLx2zqEEPRtdAX17K
---
 lib/detection/schema.ts | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/detection/schema.ts b/lib/detection/schema.ts
index ee15c804b..009e11300 100644
--- a/lib/detection/schema.ts
+++ b/lib/detection/schema.ts
@@ -55,8 +55,8 @@ export interface SigmaDetectionField {
 }
 
 export interface SigmaDetection {
-  [key: string]: SigmaDetectionField | string[];
-  condition: string | string[];
+  [key: string]: SigmaDetectionField | string[] | (string | string[]);
+  condition?: string | string[];
 }
 
 export interface SigmaRule {
